the time. Some invoices genuinely contain arithmetic errors. Which two changes?

A) Raise the retry limit from two to five, since some attempts do succeed later.
B) Retry with a larger model, since validation failures reflect limited reasoning.
C) Put the failed check, computed vs stated totals and line items into the retry.
